> > > language), x5 = fanza2 (annoyed)
> >
> > Noralujv was originally in the standard you are talking about, but I
> > ran it through a Perl program (or maybe an awk program) to expand the
> > place structure names like "t1" to "tavla1".  I am stressed for time
